    "event_type": "campaign_report",
    "level": "info",
    "message": "Request: Rédige une séquence de exactement 2 emails en français pour présenter orqAgent à des responsables support qui ne l’ont pas encore acheté et les inviter à essayer le produit. Chaque email doit donner une raison différente de passer à l’action. Ton professionnel, concret et naturel.\nDelivered 2 of 2 email(s). Average AI simulation assessment (uncalibrated) 6.0/10.\n- Email 1 \"Gardez le contrôle avant envoi\": orqAgent prépare les réponses, mais l’équipe garde la décision d’envoyer : l’envoi automatique est désactivé par défaut et chaque brouillon arrive dans une file d’approbation. - pull 6/10 - still below the 7/10 floor, and rewriting had stopped moving it after 1 rewrite(s)\n- Email 2 \"Vérifiez une politique avant tout projet\": Le lecteur peut juger orqAgent sur ses propres contenus avant toute mise en production : créer un agent, ajouter une FAQ ou une politique, puis lui soumettre des questions réellement reçues par le support. - pull 6/10 - still below the 7/10 floor after 1 rewrite(s) - and argues from none of the evidence it was assigned\nEmail(s) 1, 2 did not satisfy the simulated assessment criteria. The loop stopped rewriting them; it did not decide these were ready to send.\nEmail(s) 2 made no use of the evidence they were built on. Nothing in them is invented - but nothing in them is checkable either, and a stranger has no reason to believe a company describing itself.\nWhat held the copy back: No customer names, quotes or case studies found - the copy can describe the product but cannot prove anyone uses it\nWhat would help most next time: Resolve this simulated next-step obstacle: I would have clicked if this email had told me que je peux tester en moins d’une minute un ticket anonymisé avec un document, sans connecter ma boîte support. Check existing verified material first; surface a supported answer or documentation link appropriate to the CTA. If absent, obtain this specific information. Reader expectations are not product evidence.\n2 email(s) came in under the floor on a run configured without more than one opening per email, a panel of cold readers rather than one, the conversion critic, alternative subject lines, more than one rewrite. Those are the mechanisms the quality rests on - this run wrote one draft and kept it. Before concluding the copy cannot be better, try the same request on a preset that buys them.",
    "created_at": "2026-09-19T14:45:09.392094Z"
  },
